  "solution": "$25\\ \\text{VSD} = 24\\ \\text{MSD} \\Rightarrow 1\\ \\text{VSD} = \\dfrac{24}{25}\\ \\text{MSD}$\n\n$$\\text{LC} = 1\\ \\text{MSD} - 1\\ \\text{VSD} = \\frac{1}{25}\\ \\text{MSD} = \\frac{0.5}{25}\\ \\text{mm} = 0.02\\ \\text{mm}$$",
